@base = {{host}}/api

### Get item
# @name item
GET {{base}}/items/7
Accept: application/json

### Create item
POST {{base}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: {{$uuid}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "widget",
  "count": 3,
  "stamp": "{{$timestamp}}"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"user": "me"}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/whoami?item={{item.response.body.name}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Body from a file
POST {{host}}/echo
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payload.json

### HTML page
GET {{host}}/page.html

### Image
GET {{host}}/logo.png

### Refused
// Nothing listens on this port.
GET http://127.0.0.1:9997/nothing
